  "limitations": [
    "Original eTaskGetState, uxTaskPriorityGet and vTaskPrioritySet execute in an emulator over authored kernel state, TCBs and lists, reusing vTaskEnterCritical/ExitCritical, uxListRemove and vListInsertEnd as guarded original code; vTaskPrioritySet tail calls the original vTaskExitCritical and mret is not executed.",
